      "rationale": "Base equation defining the onlyStrings predicate on the empty ValSeq; it introduces no execution behavior or additional theorem.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-8bcfa7361e04eeb6225dd92057dababa4bf93ef43bff859c938d6dddf981efe3",
      "start_line": 9,
      "text": "  rule onlyStrings(.ValSeq) => true"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
