      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "12afafd0a0521f95ae4bb41974ef61175f0db0e7f53b5a8ab64abe0ab0182442",
      "rationale": "Structural recursive equation defining onlyStrings on vCons from the fixed isStrV observation and the predicate on the tail.",
